(6999445, 1057813, 109227, '<td valign="top">Here''s that gorgeous man again; I don''t think he can take a bad picture, plus you do it so well.</td>', 'Here''s that gorgeous man again; I don''t think he can take a bad picture, plus you do it so well.', '2013-03-13 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999463, 1057419, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of the joy and a happy, free spirit that this portrait capture presents. Great freeze frame of the hair showing a ''free spirit'' and the great wide smile that shows such joy. Excellent work.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of the joy and a happy, free spirit that this portrait capture presents. Great freeze frame of the hair showing a ''free spirit'' and the great wide smile that shows such joy. Excellent work.', '2013-03-13 21:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999465, 1058079, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>All elements come together in this stunning capture. Love the light that illuminates the whole scene. Composition and mood of the piece is lovely too. I get the feel of the early morning light and the breeze that comes through the window. It shows a moment in time where this woman &amp; her pet take a moment to enjoy the view and a quiet hour by the window... Details are fabulous - from the sharp details of the woman''s hair braids to the fur on the cat.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. All elements come together in this stunning capture. Love the light that illuminates the whole scene. Composition and mood of the piece is lovely too. I get the feel of the early morning light and the breeze that comes through the window. It shows a moment in time where this woman & her pet take a moment to enjoy the view and a quiet hour by the window... Details are fabulous - from the sharp details of the woman''s hair braids to the fur on the cat.', '2013-03-13 22:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999484, 1058140, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>There is that mischievous twinkle in the eye as he exits stage left - off to do who know what!:-) Lighting is good and details are very good. Wish you captured just a little more of that smile. I think it would have also made the composition even stronger if there was something in the backdrop the further cemented the idea of being mischievous.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. There is that mischievous twinkle in the eye as he exits stage left - off to do who know what!:-) Lighting is good and details are very good. Wish you captured just a little more of that smile. I think it would have also made the composition even stronger if there was something in the backdrop the further cemented the idea of being mischievous.', '2013-03-13 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999575, 1058173, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super cute photo. Magical eyes. Nicely isolated against the black background. Well done.</td>', 'Super cute photo. Magical eyes. Nicely isolated against the black background. Well done.', '2013-03-14 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999708, 1058269, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the ''freeze frame'' of the action that is about to happen as he makes the pitch. Lighting and details are fabulous. The tilt of the head in this composition is also great because I get the sense of the wind-up of this incoming pitch. It is not static as a facing straight forward type shot but one that speaks action and intent.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the ''freeze frame'' of the action that is about to happen as he makes the pitch. Lighting and details are fabulous. The tilt of the head in this composition is also great because I get the sense of the wind-up of this incoming pitch. It is not static as a facing straight forward type shot but one that speaks action and intent.', '2013-03-14 09:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999709, 1058077, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I really like these ''environmental'' portraits where it gives you a sense of the person by either character or where they work/play. Very clearly from the backdrop this woman is a healer and the period of dress is from days long past (pioneer days methinks). The lighting and details you captured are splendid. I do have one little critique that I feel would make the composition even stronger. I think it would have been better if you zoomed up a bit more to eliminate the bottom 20% just about where one can see that paper. Zooming up closer would have a twofold effect on the composition. First, the the backdrop of the medicine bottles would fill the scene without any distracting elements; it would further compliment the healer in her environment. Second you would bring your audience closer to the personality, showing off more details about her by getting up into the greeting distance.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I really like these ''environmental'' portraits where it gives you a sense of the person by either character or where they work/play. Very clearly from the backdrop this woman is a healer and the period of dress is from days long past (pioneer days methinks). The lighting and details you captured are splendid. I do have one little critique that I feel would make the composition even stronger. I think it would have been better if you zoomed up a bit more to eliminate the bottom 20% just about where one can see that paper. Zooming up closer would have a twofold effect on the composition. First, the the backdrop of the medicine bottles would fill the scene without any distracting elements; it would further compliment the healer in her environment. Second you would bring your audience closer to the personality, showing off more details about her by getting up into the greeting distance.', '2013-03-14 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999714, 1057537, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great details and expression captured here. Lighting is very good for it illuminates the whole face such that your audience can see the eyes, the rosy cheeks, and that happy, toothy grin. Great work.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great details and expression captured here. Lighting is very good for it illuminates the whole face such that your audience can see the eyes, the rosy cheeks, and that happy, toothy grin. Great work.', '2013-03-14 09:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999744, 1057432, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2013-03-14 10:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999749, 1058213, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, the pure arc of light, the "imperfections" of exposure bringing out a great natural feeling, a beauty enhanced by the pose and hairstyle.</td>', 'I like this very much, the pure arc of light, the "imperfections" of exposure bringing out a great natural feeling, a beauty enhanced by the pose and hairstyle.', '2013-03-14 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999753, 1057324, 12611, '<td valign="top">a picture to treasure later in life.</td>', 'a picture to treasure later in life.', '2013-03-14 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999754, 1058077, 12611, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a man I saw in an apothecary in Sturbridge Village Mass. Somehow the minimal works with the natural light and less than dramatic exposure, fitting for the harsh olden times...</td>', 'Reminds me of a man I saw in an apothecary in Sturbridge Village Mass. Somehow the minimal works with the natural light and less than dramatic exposure, fitting for the harsh olden times...', '2013-03-14 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999757, 1057253, 12611, '<td valign="top">I initially thought this was a nice shot, nothing special, a 5, but looking at this child''s smile, it is impossible not to smile back. very well done-9</td>', 'I initially thought this was a nice shot, nothing special, a 5, but looking at this child''s smile, it is impossible not to smile back. very well done-9', '2013-03-14 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999758, 1058271, 12611, '<td valign="top">very well done.</td>', 'very well done.', '2013-03-14 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
