(6999762, 1056807, 12611, '<td valign="top">a great shot, and probably the worst title ever for a photo- sounds like a catch phrase from a Batman villain, or a very bad third world game show.) <br/>I am going to pretend its a language based misunderstanding, and translate it in my mind to be titled "In the time of disease."</td>', 'a great shot, and probably the worst title ever for a photo- sounds like a catch phrase from a Batman villain, or a very bad third world game show.) I am going to pretend its a language based misunderstanding, and translate it in my mind to be titled "In the time of disease."', '2013-03-14 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
