(7001009, 1057419, 124982, '<td valign="top">Incredibly dynamic. Quite a beautiful shot. Wonder if voters are going to have an issue with this not being a "traditional" portrait. I dont - I think it''s great!</td>', 'Incredibly dynamic. Quite a beautiful shot. Wonder if voters are going to have an issue with this not being a "traditional" portrait. I dont - I think it''s great!', '2013-03-15 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001011, 1057908, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely oranges - color and texture and lighting is spot on!! but this is a portrait challenge, right?</td>', 'Lovely oranges - color and texture and lighting is spot on!! but this is a portrait challenge, right?', '2013-03-15 18:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001013, 1057813, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait -- the pose and sharpness and focus is spot on!! Lighting is a little flat though. Some more contrasty light and this would be great!</td>', 'Lovely portrait -- the pose and sharpness and focus is spot on!! Lighting is a little flat though. Some more contrasty light and this would be great!', '2013-03-15 18:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001015, 1057185, 124982, '<td valign="top">Fine line between high key and overblown. This is probably more towards the latter -- but it still works. Quite a unique image that definitely makes the viewer linger. Nice going.</td>', 'Fine line between high key and overblown. This is probably more towards the latter -- but it still works. Quite a unique image that definitely makes the viewer linger. Nice going.', '2013-03-15 18:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001016, 1058079, 124982, '<td valign="top">My my...that is some beautiful lighting! Love the hair! While I normally am not a fan of closed eyes on a portrait, this just works. What is she thinking about?</td>', 'My my...that is some beautiful lighting! Love the hair! While I normally am not a fan of closed eyes on a portrait, this just works. What is she thinking about?', '2013-03-15 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001017, 1058173, 124982, '<td valign="top">Exquisite lighting and detail. Just wonderful!!</td>', 'Exquisite lighting and detail. Just wonderful!!', '2013-03-15 18:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001018, 1057985, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and contrasty, powerful lighting.</td>', 'Nice pose and contrasty, powerful lighting.', '2013-03-15 18:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001094, 1057184, 153814, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot.<br/>I hope you don''t get low voted for having two people in the shot.<br/>This is wonderful. Well done.</td>', 'What a cool shot.I hope you don''t get low voted for having two people in the shot.This is wonderful. Well done.', '2013-03-15 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001096, 1057419, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very refreshing to see something different.<br/>All around great shot.<br/>Is that a leaf in her hair?<br/>Don''t worry I wont tell anyone.:P</td>', 'Very refreshing to see something different.All around great shot.Is that a leaf in her hair?Don''t worry I wont tell anyone.:P', '2013-03-15 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001097, 1058271, 153814, '<td valign="top">Bottom of the 9th, full count, two dead, with the bases juiced. The Giants holding on to a one point lead here in game seven. Jetter on 3rd, Ichiro at 2nd, Granderson on 1st and Cano at the plate. The pitcher sets he deals IT''S IN THERE FOR A CALLED STRIKE THREE. WOW that was exciting.<br/>As a Mets fan if the Mets don''t win it, it could be any other team besides those dirty yankees.<br/>Oh great shot by the way.</td>', 'Bottom of the 9th, full count, two dead, with the bases juiced. The Giants holding on to a one point lead here in game seven. Jetter on 3rd, Ichiro at 2nd, Granderson on 1st and Cano at the plate. The pitcher sets he deals IT''S IN THERE FOR A CALLED STRIKE THREE. WOW that was exciting.As a Mets fan if the Mets don''t win it, it could be any other team besides those dirty yankees.Oh great shot by the way.', '2013-03-15 20:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001119, 1057185, 157380, '<td valign="top">I very much like the styling of this image, the high key subtle shapes and textures giving enough information to complete the portrait without giving it all away as in a generic template shot.</td>', 'I very much like the styling of this image, the high key subtle shapes and textures giving enough information to complete the portrait without giving it all away as in a generic template shot.', '2013-03-15 21:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001125, 1058036, 157380, '<td valign="top">I feel that within this challenge your image does the best job at projecting a character off the screen.</td>', 'I feel that within this challenge your image does the best job at projecting a character off the screen.', '2013-03-15 21:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001272, 1058017, 100831, '<td valign="top">adorable.Love this.</td>', 'adorable.Love this.', '2013-03-16 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001275, 1058079, 100831, '<td valign="top">Stunning light... fabulous minimal portrait. Everything is just so.... right.</td>', 'Stunning light... fabulous minimal portrait. Everything is just so.... right.', '2013-03-16 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001276, 1058027, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, just wonderful... Excellent tones and lines... a gorgeous example of how minimal should work. You got the hands ... perfectly, I think for attention. I''m no artist so I can''t say for sure it''d be better, but I''d love to see other crops of this from the top (hope you don''t mind my comment).</td>', 'Wonderful, just wonderful... Excellent tones and lines... a gorgeous example of how minimal should work. You got the hands ... perfectly, I think for attention. I''m no artist so I can''t say for sure it''d be better, but I''d love to see other crops of this from the top (hope you don''t mind my comment).', '2013-03-16 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001277, 1058202, 100831, '<td valign="top">Bella is gorgeous!!! Love the softness, overall, and her serious gaze (but with a glint in her eye).</td>', 'Bella is gorgeous!!! Love the softness, overall, and her serious gaze (but with a glint in her eye).', '2013-03-16 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
