(7001354, 1057927, 16106, '<td valign="top">I almost always love a good reflection, but in this case I think the feeling of solitude is broken by the reflection. A lovely shot and perfectly exposed, and without the reflection it would have been in the ribbons. Great work on the blue fill light on the arms.</td>', 'I almost always love a good reflection, but in this case I think the feeling of solitude is broken by the reflection. A lovely shot and perfectly exposed, and without the reflection it would have been in the ribbons. Great work on the blue fill light on the arms.', '2013-03-16 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
