(7002314, 1058269, 82999, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this higher if his face wasn''t in shadow.  I would have added a soft light up front or off to the side.</td>', 'I would have scored this higher if his face wasn''t in shadow.  I would have added a soft light up front or off to the side.', '2013-03-18 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
